  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 305.77,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "方法表把几十年压成四个阶段。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 309.79,
   "dur": 5.73,
   "speech": "统计学习，代表是 ARIMA、ETS、Theta、VAR。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 316.07,
   "dur": 2.46,
   "speech": "偏置写在方程里。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 319.08,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "假设线性、平稳、误差有分布。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 323.29,
   "dur": 5.01,
   "speech": "好处是可解释，坏处是难处理非线性和多变量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 328.85,
   "dur": 6.97,
   "speech": "机器学习，代表是 XGBoost、GBRT、随机森林、LightGBM。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 336.37,
   "dur": 2.41,
   "speech": "偏置写在特征里。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 339.33,
   "dur": 4.14,
   "speech": "人先造出滞后、滚动均值、日历特征。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 344.03,
   "dur": 4.36,
   "speech": "好处是模型多样，坏处是依赖特征工程。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 348.93,
   "dur": 4.29,
   "speech": "深度学习，代表从 MLP 到 Transformer。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 353.77,
   "dur": 2.39,
   "speech": "偏置写在结构里。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 356.71,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speech": "卷积假设局部，循环假设递推，注意力假设全局相关。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 362.7,
   "dur": 4.33,
   "speech": "好处是自动表征，坏处是算力和数据。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 367.58,
   "dur": 5.46,
   "speech": "预训练大模型，代表是 TimesFM、Moirai、Chronos。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 373.59,
   "dur": 2.37,
   "speech": "偏置写在数据里。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 376.51,
   "dur": 4.98,
   "speech": "先在大量序列上预训练，再用少量任务数据适配。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 382.04,
   "dur": 4.02,
   "speech": "好处是泛化，坏处是可解释性和成本。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 386.61,
   "dur": 3.33,
   "speech": "这四次迁移，不是简单替代。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 390.49,
   "dur": 2.73,
   "speech": "统计模型今天还在用。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 393.77,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "深度模型也不总比树模型好。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 397.71,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "大模型更不是所有任务的默认答案。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 401.95,
   "dur": 3.9,
   "speech": "真正变的是，人把假设放在了哪里。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 406.4,
   "dur": 4.26,
   "speech": "从方程，到特征，到结构，到数据。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 411.21,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "每一次搬家，都换来了新的能力。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 415.16,
   "dur": 2.89,
   "speech": "也换走了旧的可解释性。"
  },
  {
